{"id":"ab52c563964e3a2d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-invariant.md","title":"Invariant","display":"df-invariant — Invariant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-invariant","aliases":["58-df-invariant","Invariant","Topological Invariant"],"display":"df-invariant — Invariant","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-invariant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-invariant</span><span>Invariant</span><span>Topological Invariant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-invariant — Invariant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr X,P\\in V\\land P\\subseteq\\mathscr X\">\\(\\mathscr X,P\\in V\\land P\\subseteq\\mathscr X\\)</span> (set-coded collection of topological spaces and invariant subcollection)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (homeomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalInvariantOn}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalInvariantOn}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (set-relative invariant predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}invariant} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopologicalInvariantOn}_S(P,\\mathscr X) \\leftrightarrow P\\subseteq\\mathscr X\\land\\forall\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle,\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\left((\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y))\\to(\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in P)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}invariant} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopologicalInvariantOn}_S(P,\\mathscr X) \\leftrightarrow P\\subseteq\\mathscr X\\land\\forall\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle,\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\left((\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y))\\to(\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in P)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A topological property is represented by a set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> of coded spaces inside a set-sized comparison domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr X\">\\(\\mathscr X\\)</span>; the definition does not quantify over predicates or functions on the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^2\">\\(V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Invariant: preserved under homeomorphism</li>\n<li>Examples: compactness, connectedness, dimension, homology</li>\n<li>Complete invariant: determines space up to homeomorphism</li>\n<li>Bordism: equivalence relation generated by manifolds with boundary</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-invariant: determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-theory class</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathscr X,P\\in V\\land P\\subseteq\\mathscr X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalInvariantOn}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}invariant} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopologicalInvariantOn}_S(P,\\mathscr X) \\leftrightarrow P\\subseteq\\mathscr X\\land\\forall\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\forall\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle,\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\left((\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y))\\to(\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in P)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr X","display":false},{"tex":"V^2","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1810,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-701","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-invariant.md|58-df-invariant]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["c4b4a825f2ea608d","815e63e5071e7b58"]}